  "description": "Every NHDPlusV2 catchment in the USGS Reference Hydrologic Geospatial Fabric (https://www.sciencebase.gov/catalog/item/61295190d34e40dd9c06bcd7) joined to the uri of the Geoconnex reference mainstem its flowline is part of, derived from the NHDPlusV2 lookup in the ref_rivers v3.2 release (https://github.com/internetofwater/ref_rivers/releases/tag/v3.2).\n\nGeoconnex uses this file during the harvest to associate each feature with the mainstem of the catchment containing it. The mainstem uri is in the 'geoconnex_url' column, which is empty for catchments whose flowline is not part of a mainstem.\n\nThe source code that generated this file can be found at https://github.com/internetofwater/scheduler/blob/main/userCode/assetGroups/processed.py",
